\newlabel{fig:calibration_reliability}{{4}{11}{\textbf {Calibration Reliability Diagram Across Baselines (H1).} Bin-wise predicted confidence vs observed positive fraction over 10 equal-width bins. AEGIS-SL (ECE 0.043) closely tracks the ideal $y=x$ diagonal, outperforming monolithic BL2 (ECE 0.087) and ERA5-only BL1 (ECE 0.214)}{figure.4}{}}
